Package: wsgnstat
Type: Package
Title: The Wrapped Skew Generalised Normal Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("M. Theodor", "Loots", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "theo.loots@gmail.com")
Description: The skew generalised normal distribution on the line, constructed as a scale mixture of
    a uniform and a generalised gamma variable, and its wrapped version on the circle, with density,
    characteristic function, trigonometric moments, random generation, and estimation by the method
    of trigonometric moments (minimum distance, with sandwich standard errors) and by maximum
    likelihood. The characteristic function is evaluated through absolutely convergent integrals
    (the Fox H-function route), so every routine is available for all positive shape parameters,
    not only where the Fox-Wright series converges. A pure-C back-end does the numerics and also
    backs the Python package 'wsgnstat'.
URL: https://github.com/mtloots/wsgnstat
BugReports: https://github.com/mtloots/wsgnstat/issues
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats
NeedsCompilation: yes
